<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's KLTC to seek 5,000 tonnes of pork.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's KLTC to seek 5,000 tonnes of pork.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Livestock Trading Corp (KLTC) said on Monday it will invite tenders for 5,000 tonnes of frozen pork by 11.00 a.m. (0200 GMT) on February 12.  </p>
<p>The tender was divided into two positions; arrival for each position was set for Seoul and Pusan.</p>
<p>Details for the tenders are as follows:</p>
<p>POSITION  TYPE		    TONNE   SHIPMENT  ARRIVAL</p>
<p>  ONE     Short-ribbed belly  1,740   Apr 10    Seoul</p>
<p>	    Collar or Butt	  460   Apr 10    Seoul</p>
<p>	    Short-ribbed belly    260   Apr 10    Pusan</p>
<p>	    Collar or Butt	   40   Apr 10    Pusan</p>
<p>  TWO     Short-ribbed belly  1,760   Apr 20    Seoul</p>
<p>	    Collar or Butt	  440   Apr 20    Seoul</p>
<p>	    Short-ribbed belly    240   Apr 20    Pusan</p>
<p>	    Collar or Butt	   60   Apr 20    Pusan</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
